  itemDescription: "Once a blade of legend, this straight sword carved through battlefields
    with unmatched grace, its edge keen as moonlight. Forged in dragonfire, it never
    dulled\u2014until its master fell. Now, abandoned in a forgotten ruin, rust devours
    its brilliance, and the wind mourns the echoes of its former glory."
